<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">3 YOHANE</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yo</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">YOHANE NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NZA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANE</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NZA</para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Yohane hworɔle krataa he mane Kristoniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Gaius. Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle ye nwomaa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ nabo ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ ɔfa hyɛle ɛhe abo ɔ. Na edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa lili dwumaa ne kyire kyi, ne Gaius te ye damvo paa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɔ krataa he anu ne, Yohane kamvole Gaius kyɛ odɛ́ aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛte ɛwɔfoɛ ne kama, na ɔhane biaa bie bɔ ɔha adwene nwo dwirɛ, né bɛfrɛ ye Diotrefe. Né Diotrefe te pɛsɛmengominya paa, né ɔdwɔso tia asomafoɛ akwankyerɛ, na ne ɔpena kyɛ odi nikye biala nyunu wɔ asafo nanu. Né Diotrefe le subammɔne, ye ahɔ a, onne aliemaa mɔ ngɔ ye awuro, na bɛ bɔ bɛpena kyɛ bedɛ bɛ ne kosi, ne osi bɛ atee, na otu bɛ fi asafo nanu po. Na ne ɛhene sɛkye asomdwie bɔ ɔwɔ asafo nanu ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nakoso Demetrio de, né aliemaa mɔ ka ye nwo dwirɛ pa. Ebia ye po yeɛ ɔfale krataa he ɔɔmane Gaius ɔ. Yohane kamvole Gaius kyɛ wanzuesua sɔ suban ne bie, na ɔhyɛle ye nguraen kyɛ nnɛmaa osuesua bie. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:11">3Yo 11</ref></char>) Ɔmaa onwuni kyɛ, ɔngɔhyɛ ɔkɔwa berɛ, na ɔba a, ole edwirɛ pee bɔ ɔne ye kɔbɔ ye nwo ngɔmmɔ ɔ.―<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:13">3Yo 13</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Sɔ dwirɛ he kyire kyɛ, sɛ Kristofoɛ amva Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne ammɔ bɛ bra a, ahomasoɛ kɔhora kɔsɛkye asomdwie bɔ ɔwɔ asafo nanu ne.</para>
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa ne mbaeɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔkamvole Gaius (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:5-8">1:5-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Diotrefe pena kyɛ odi anyunu wɔ nikye biala nu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:9-10">1:9-10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛka Demetrio nwo dwirɛ pa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:11-12">1:11-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nzrahwɛ ne ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:13-14">1:13-14</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Me bɔ nde panyi ne;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Mefa krataa he mekɔma Gaius, bɔ medɔ ye wɔ nahorɛ nanu ne.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Nniema, me mbaeɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ nikye biala hɔ yé ma wɔ, na enya anwoserɛ, kyɛbɔ wasi wɔ kra yé ne. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Mmerɛ bɔ aliemaa nemɔ wale, na bɛlili nahorɛ bɔ etira nu, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɛfa nahorɛ ne bɔ wɔ bra<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kyɛbɔ ɛnate nahorɛ nanu ne.”</char></note> nanwo adanzeɛ ne, me nye gyele paa. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Nikye fee nne berɛ bɔ ɔmaa me nye gye tra kyɛ, ngɔte kyɛ me mmaa mɔ nate nahorɛ nanu ɔ.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Nniema, nikye biala bɔ ɛyɛ ma aliemaa mɔ ne, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ bɛte ɛwɔfoɛ ne, okyire kyɛ edi nahorɛ. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Bali wɔ dɔ nanwo adanzeɛ bahyire asafo ne, yeti mesrɛ wɔ, gua bɛ atee kama, kyɛbɔ ɔfata wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Ofikyɛ ye dumaa nu ti yeɛ bɛhɔle ɔ, na banne hwee bamvi maen-maen nanufoɛ ne berɛ. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Yeti, odikyɛ yedɛ sɔ mmenia nemɔ kama,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛ boka sɔ mmenia nemɔ.”</char></note> na wamaa yaboka bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ nahorɛ nanwo adwuma naso.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Ndworɔle krataa ngɔmane asafo ne, nakoso Diotrefe bɔ ɔpena kyɛ odi bɛ nyunu wɔ asafo nanu ne bu nningyein bɔ ofi yɛ berɛ ne animtia. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Yeti meba a, ngɔmaa okonwu nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ ne, yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔkeka yɛ nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ. Na ɛhene po anzo ye nu, ye ahɔ a, onne aliemaa mɔ ngɔ ye awuro, na bɛ bɔ bɛpena kyɛ bedɛ bɛ ne koso, osi bɛ atee, na otu bɛ fi asafo nanu po.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Nniema, nnɛsue nikye bɔ ɔttemaye, mmom, sua pa. Ofikyɛ bɔ ɔyɛ nikye pa ne fi Nyameɛ berɛ, na bɔ ɔyɛ bɔne ne de, ɔnze Nyameɛ.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Demetrio de, ebiala di ye nwo adanzeɛ, na nahorɛ ne koso di ye nwo adanzeɛ. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛ koso, yɛdi ye nwo adanzeɛ, na ɛse kyɛ y'adanzeɛ ne te nahorɛ.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Nne edwirɛ pee bɔ odikyɛ meka mekyire wɔ ɔ, nakoso menguro kyɛ metworɔ ye wɔ krataa so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Mefa krataa ne pɛn metworɔ.”</char></note> <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Mmom mese kyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ ngɔwa ngɔɔnea wɔ boso, na yali ngɔmmɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:14">Asomdwie ha wɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:14">Wɔ nnamvo bɔ bɛwɔ wa ne nwa bɛkyea wɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:14">Bobɔ yɛ nnamvo nemɔ dumaa ngoko-ngoko kyẽa bɛ ma yɛ.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />-<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>